        <article><div class="bdet__fig" data-fig="optical"></div><h3 ${q(`b.det.2.name`)}>When the optical cut takes over</h3><p ${q(`b.det.2.body`)}>Below a 30 px symbol box (about ${Bd(30).toFixed(1)} px of drawing), the master starts to fill one of its gaps with grey. The optical cut, with three wider bands and the same clearing, takes over there. The favicon uses it at 14 px inside a 16 px tile.</p></article>
